    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠬᠠᠳᠬᠣᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>qadqoqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хатгах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XADXU-</transcript>
      <definition>[=xadxa-] v. t. a) To pierce, stab, prick; to embroider; to pin; to sting, bite ( as snake or insects), peck; to treat with acupuncture; to have a sharp pain b) To incite trouble; to excite, spur, urge, stimulate.</definition>
      <page>904</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠳᠬᠣᠬᠣ ᠡᠪᠡᠳᠴᠢᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>--xu ebedcin</transcript>
          <definition> Colic.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠠᠭᠠᠨ᠎ᠠ ᠬᠠᠳᠬᠣᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>baγan-a --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To drive a post into the ground.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠢᠯᠳᠦᠨ ᠢ ᠭᠠᠵᠠᠷ ᠎ᠲᠤᠷ ᠬᠠᠳᠬᠣᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>ildyn i γazar tur --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To stick sword into the ground.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠶᠠᠭ᠎ᠠ ᠬᠠᠳᠬᠣᠵᠤ ᠰᠠᠭᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>xajaγ-a --zu saγuxu</transcript>
          <definition> To live near by.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠤᠸᠠᠷ ᠬᠠᠳᠬᠣᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>xuvar --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To embroider flower designs or patterns.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠳᠬᠣᠨ ᠡᠳᠦᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n edygeky</transcript>
          <definition> To instigate, incite.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠳᠬᠣᠨ ᠺᠥᠳᠡᠯᠭᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
